Package: choose-mirror
Package-Type: udeb
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, configured-network, choose-mirror-bin
Description: Choose mirror to install from
 Athena fork: the XB-Installer-Menu-Item (2300) is dropped on purpose so this
 does NOT run as an early standalone main-menu step (before base install).
 apt-setup's 50mirror invokes choose-mirror during the package-manager step,
 after the base system is installed — the standard CD-install flow.

